cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository in your work, please cite it as follows."
title: "Garden-of-Iris"
abstract: >-
  Experimental toolkit for Iris, a collective-intelligence language model:
  a Discord bot, a hindsight summarization pipeline over the FourThought
  dialectic, a web/PDF thought-type parser, and supporting data tooling.
  Stewarded by the Active Inference Institute.
authors:
  - name: "Active Inference Institute"
    affiliation: "Active Inference Institute"
    website: "https://www.activeinference.org"
keywords:
  - collective intelligence
  - language model
  - fourthought
  - dialectic
  - active inference
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: "2022-08-03"
